<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="22666128"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="504475505"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="GALLOWS BELL"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ナノ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="nanoir"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:44.484"><div begin="00:00.880" end="03:14.103"><p begin="00:00.880" end="00:03.887" itunes:key="L1">Darkness locks me into this room<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以下歌词翻译由文曲大模型提供</span></p><p begin="00:03.887" end="00:06.894" itunes:key="L2">The air I breathe has never felt so cold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼吸间的空气从未如此冰冷刺骨</span></p><p begin="00:06.894" end="00:09.901" itunes:key="L3">And I'm losing hold of everything I had<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正眼睁睁看着一切从指尖滑落</span></p><p begin="00:10.899" end="00:12.908" itunes:key="L4">So I'll rock myself to sleep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是我锁闭心门 沉入长眠</span></p><p begin="00:13.906" end="00:16.913" itunes:key="L5">Her beautiful smile was always just for him<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她那凄美的笑容 曾唯他独绽</span></p><p begin="00:16.913" end="00:19.932" itunes:key="L6">Every corner of her heart was filled with her love for him<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她心房的每一寸角落</span></p><p begin="00:20.930" end="00:22.939" itunes:key="L7">Even when the time would come to say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使那时刻终将来临</span></p><p begin="00:23.937" end="00:25.946" itunes:key="L8">This is what she'd say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她会这样轻声呢喃：</span></p><p begin="00:26.944" end="00:28.953" itunes:key="L9">There's nothing to cry for, I want you to know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“无需为我哭泣，</span></p><p begin="00:29.951" end="00:32.958" itunes:key="L10">As long as it's you, this pain couldn't hurt me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要是为了你</span></p><p begin="00:32.958" end="00:35.965" itunes:key="L11">No reason to regret, I'll always be waiting for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此生已绝无遗憾</span></p><p begin="00:36.975" end="00:38.972" itunes:key="L12">My love, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吾爱</span></p><p begin="00:39.982" end="00:42.978" itunes:key="L13">It'll be alright, I want you to know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊——</span></p><p begin="00:42.978" end="00:45.985" itunes:key="L14">I'll always believe in the truth of your words<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远深信你言语中的真意</span></p><p begin="00:45.985" end="00:49.073" itunes:key="L15">The only thing unreal was<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯一虚无缥缈的</span></p><p begin="00:50.002" end="00:54.007" itunes:key="L16">My place in your heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我在你心底留下的虚位</span></p><p begin="01:03.932" end="01:06.939" itunes:key="L17">She could feel his words wrap around her neck<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她能感到他的言语</span></p><p begin="01:06.939" end="01:09.935" itunes:key="L18">Her very last breath was swallowed into silence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她最后一丝微弱的呼吸</span></p><p begin="01:09.935" end="01:12.942" itunes:key="L19">And everything they had together fell away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终没入永恒的静谧</span></p><p begin="01:13.952" end="01:15.960" itunes:key="L20">This is how their story ends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是他们故事的终局</span></p><p begin="01:16.959" end="01:19.826" itunes:key="L21">Surrounded by an iron barricade<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被无形的铁牢重重围困</span></p><p begin="01:19.826" end="01:22.833" itunes:key="L22">Gazing at the light with eyes of lead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">铅灰色的双眸 凝视着微光</span></p><p begin="01:23.843" end="01:25.840" itunes:key="L23">Even after all the time gone by<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任凭岁月的灰烬悄然堆积</span></p><p begin="01:26.850" end="01:28.859" itunes:key="L24">This is what he'd say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他会这样沉重地诉说：</span></p><p begin="01:29.857" end="01:31.866" itunes:key="L25">I look at these hands that are stained with blood and<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我凝视着这双手</span></p><p begin="01:32.864" end="01:35.871" itunes:key="L26">They'll never bring back all the things that they took<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它们永远无法带回</span></p><p begin="01:35.871" end="01:38.878" itunes:key="L27">So I won't turn back, I'll find you again someday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我已断绝退路</span></p><p begin="01:39.877" end="01:41.885" itunes:key="L28">I know, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深知如此</span></p><p begin="01:42.884" end="01:45.891" itunes:key="L29">If only the tears would erase all the memories<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若泪水能洗净罪孽</span></p><p begin="01:45.891" end="01:48.898" itunes:key="L30">Then maybe I'd learn to fight all these fears<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我就能学会对抗这些恐惧</span></p><p begin="01:48.898" end="01:51.905" itunes:key="L31">Won't hesitate, won't run away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再退缩，亦不再逃避</span></p><p begin="01:51.905" end="01:55.922" itunes:key="L32">These are things I'm scared to say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些都是我不敢言说的战栗……</span></p><p begin="02:22.985" end="02:24.993" itunes:key="L33">As he is standing in light that is fading<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当他伫立在渐行渐远的残阳里</span></p><p begin="02:25.992" end="02:28.000" itunes:key="L34">He's feeling the trembling beat of his heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受着内心震颤的悸动</span></p><p begin="02:28.999" end="02:33.016" itunes:key="L35">And he remembers the sound of her very last words<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他再次听到了那阵回响</span></p><p begin="02:33.016" end="02:35.013" itunes:key="L36">Again, again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度</span></p><p begin="02:35.013" end="02:38.020" itunes:key="L37">There's nothing to cry for, I want you to know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周而复始</span></p><p begin="02:39.030" end="02:42.037" itunes:key="L38">As long as it's you, this pain couldn't hurt me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要是为了你</span></p><p begin="02:42.037" end="02:45.044" itunes:key="L39">No reason to regret, I'll always be waiting for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此生已绝无遗憾</span></p><p begin="02:46.042" end="02:48.051" itunes:key="L40">My love, my love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吾爱</span></p><p begin="02:49.049" end="02:52.056" itunes:key="L41">It'll be alright, I want you to know that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吾爱</span></p><p begin="02:52.056" end="02:55.063" itunes:key="L42">I'll always believe in the truth of your words<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远深信你言语中的真意</span></p><p begin="02:55.063" end="02:58.070" itunes:key="L43">With open arms, he looks to the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他坦然张开双臂 仰望苍穹</span></p><p begin="02:58.070" end="03:01.077" itunes:key="L44">Finally, I've found my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于，我找到了归宿</span></p><p begin="03:02.076" end="03:05.094" itunes:key="L45">My way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是通往你身边的路</span></p><p begin="03:08.101" end="03:14.103" itunes:key="L46">My way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是奔向你的归途</span></p></div></body></tt>